# Build output and vendored/lock files — not hand-edited.
/build/
/nogit/
/lang/
package-lock.json

# Content notes are authored in an Obsidian vault and moved here byte-identical
# (#1441). Prettier's defaults already match what Obsidian writes, so it has
# nothing to do on all but a handful of hand-tidied Markdown tables — and
# reformatting those would trade a verifiable "these files are exactly the
# authored notes" for column padding. The tree's own README is ours, so it is
# still formatted.
assets/content/**/*.md
!assets/content/README.md
